  "summary": "The paper presents one quantum experiment: a 9-qubit quantum reservoir computing model for volatility regime-change detection on 29 Dow Jones stocks from 2015–2020. It reports test accuracy/precision of 0.923/0.890 for the quantum reservoir with logistic regression readout, compared with 0.895/0.835 for the classical reservoir and 0.872/0.904 for the best raw-data SVM baseline; the quantum model is simulated noiselessly in Qiskit and no practical speedup is demonstrated.",
